{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1541138-101-curseborne-plot-hooks","id":1541138,"title":"101 Curseborne Plot Hooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-28T13:22:38-07:00","id":1541138,"title":"101 Curseborne Plot Hooks","content":"After the <a href=\"https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/episode-325-curseborne-campaign-ideas/\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Pathcast episode on Curseborne Campaign Ideas</a>, I thought I'd try making a thread for 101 ideas of Curseborne Plot Hooks. Some of these I admit are more Story Arc plot hooks as opposed to entire Campaign ideas, but feel free to add to the list:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Orphans </b>- The Group runs an Accursed Orphanage to help people who didn\u2019t know they were Accursed when their curses manifested.</li> <li><b>Accursed Shelter</b> - The Group runs a shelter for Accursed who are trying to escape the reach of their toxic Family.</li> <li><b>Test Subjects</b> - The Group are test subjects for a scientist who has just discovered Accursed exist.</li> <li><b>Schoolmates </b>- The Group are students at a school dedicated to teaching new Accursed.</li> <li><b>Coworkers </b>- The Group are Accursed who happen to work in the same office building.</li> <li><b>Deferment </b>- The Group is in charge of organizing a new place of deferment in the area.</li> <li><b>Map Makers</b> - The Group is in charge of mapping the Luminalities in the area.</li> <li><b>Missing Accursed</b> - The Group is investigating the disappearances of missing Accursed.</li> <li><b>Custody Battle</b> - The Group encounters an Accursed trying to leave their Family for another.</li> <li><b>Family Feud</b> - Tensions are high as multiple Families are in conflict with one another.</li> <li><b>Territory Dispute</b> - The borders between multiple Families have come into question, leading to conflict.</li> <li><b>Succession </b>- Family leader has announced their new successor, but there are multiple conspiracies. Some want to get a different successor, others want the new successor to be leader sooner than expected\u2026</li> <li><b>Heist </b>- The Group is hired to steal a cursed artifact that has turned up.</li> <li><b>New Arrivals</b> - A new Family arrives in the neighborhood and they are looking to expand their territory.</li> <li><b>Family Tournament</b> - To relieve stress, the Families organize a competition every year. The Families put territory up as collateral.\u200b</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-14T10:19:48-07:00","id":1543765,"title":"","content":"16. <b>Trenchcoats and Katanas</b> Just run it like we ran Vampire in the 90s - there's Politics happening and you all dress like Neo from the Matrix and fight like the Bride from Kill Bill.<br /> <br /> 17. <b>Occult Flat Share</b> rent in the city is through the roof so you're sharing with three other people and the Sorcerer keeps sacrificing the milk and you'd be fine with that only she never actually *buys* the milk but you do and now you have nothing to put on your cereal.<br /> <br /> 18. <b>Obligatory PI Campaign</b> when something's strange in the neighbourhood they call you, specifically<br /> <br /> 19. <b>The Fall of Beziers</b> the Albigensian Crusade is closing in on the city of Beziers. Sure they're mostly looking for Cathars but you're pretty sure they also won't much like werewolves. Also at least one of you is a Cathar *and* a werewolf.<br /> <br /> 20. <b>A Shadow Over Innsmouth</b> you and your Spawn of Vodnik friends had been living quietly in this lovely fishing village minding your own business when some utter bastard from Arkham waltzed in and got all freaked out because you didn't look and act exactly the way he wanted you to. Now the actual *feds* are coming and it's up to you to defend your hometown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-14T20:30:44-07:00","id":1543822,"title":"","content":"<b>21. Search for a Killer</b><br /> Something seemingly supernatural is committing murders in the region. Local accursed are worried about the fallout, so the prominent regional families each send a member to create an investigatory team.<br /> <br /> <b>22. The Runaway</b><br /> A young girl from one of the more insular inbred accursed families runs away to escape an arranged marriage with her creepy uncle. Helping her could instigate a conflict between her family and other accursed families in the area.<br /> <br /> <b>23. The Obsessed Detective</b><br /> A local police detective witnesses one of the accursed players using a supernatural power or gas evidence that they have committed a crime. The detective knows a supernatural creature is out there and won\u2019t rest until it is caught.<br /> <br /> <b>24. The Treasure</b><br /> The characters come across some highly desired treasure or artifact. It is highly sought after and valuable. Can the players sell it for big money, avoid being killed by those who covet it, or unlock its mysteries?<br /> <br /> <b>25. Natural Disaster</b><br /> There is a terrible natural disaster in the area. Local accursed may have to team up to save lives, maintain order, or to hold on to valuable resources. A very topical one for me personally, living in the Appalachian mountains.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-06T18:11:18-08:00","id":1545502,"title":"","content":"This is a fantastic list and inspired me to do my own!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-10-2024, 10:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-15T14:26:46-07:00","id":1551052,"title":"","content":"<b>26. Demon Investigator: Shadow Tourney Arc</b>: Some insane crime ring has decided to hold a lethal underground tournament between Accursed, and you've been blackmailed to compete by the champion team's frontman, a powerful Hyde. It's also quite clear the tournament's organizers hate you specifically, so you're going to need to cheat somehow just to keep up - and make it so they don't notice.<br /> <br /> <b>27: Deception Sword: Stab Happy Chaos: </b>You and your crew have been abducted and forced to compete in a &quot;survival game&quot; to escape a large, if luxurious, underground complex. The robotic plush serving as &quot;referee&quot; informs you that while you can trust your team, only a murder of one of another team's own and successfully stealing their emblem, along with getting away with it, will enable you to escape. Being found out means that whoever knew about the plot in advance or helped cover it up dies by torture - and victory for one team means death for all the others. Oh yeah, and they'll be throwing in a bunch of incentives too, just to be clear. Will you win or will you learn the truth and escape?<br /> <br /> (Yes, these are shameless ripoffs.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}